  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nutrition and the epigenome: early environmental factors influencing human developmental programming</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">iMRC PSMB award seeking to better understand HOW diet affects the laying down of these methylation marks, WHICH areas of the methylome are especially sensitive to such influences, HOW they influence the development of the placenta and fetus, and ultimately WHAT effects these changes have on the baby&apos;s development and life-long health. This activity benefits Malawi;Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
